graph TB
    A[客户端连接建立] --> B[设置socket超时30秒]

    B --> C{proto_recv_msg接收请求}

    C --> D{switch command}

    D -->|CMD_MKDIR| E[handle_mkdir]
    D -->|CMD_UPLOAD| F[handle_upload]
    D -->|CMD_DOWNLOAD| G[handle_download]
    D -->|CMD_LIST| H[handle_list]
    D -->|CMD_DELETE| I[handle_delete]
    D -->|CMD_RENAME| J[handle_rename]

    E --> K[destroy_msg释放消息]
    F --> K
    G --> K
    H --> K
    I --> K
    J --> K

    K --> C

    C -->|客户端断开| L[close关闭连接]

    style A fill:#2196f3
    style D fill:#ff9800
